Here are the step-by-step instructions for Firebase Firestore and the fully updated code for Admin.html and Admin.js to add the new Additional Applicant Information & Declarations table.
Part 1: Step-by-Step Instructions for Firebase Firestore Console
To include this new section, add these 6 documents into your existing application_form_fields collection with the section field set to additional_info.
Step 1: Open Firebase Console
 * Go to console.firebase.google.com.
 * Open your project card for myAtlas.
 * In the left sidebar, click on Firestore Database.
 * Select your collection named application_form_fields.
